{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object, assessing its properties. Move towards it if in view. Scan throughout.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInView    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = AssessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
